This file contains the running times of executing the edge extraction process
by using traditional Sobel filters and our EK filters on the real images.
The times are taken on a Lenovo B5-30 with Intel Core I5-446OT x 4
running Python 3.12.3 under Linux Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS operating system.

The script  make_real_times  is provided to run the same experiments again.
See comments inside.

The program  print_times.py  is provided to print the running times in human readable way. 
